1.  Role & Mission

Product Role
A virtual co-working platform that pairs people together in live, structured focus sessions using body-doubling psychology — the proven productivity phenomenon where the mere presence of another person boosts accountability and output.

Mission Statement
"Turn solitary work into shared momentum."
We help freelancers, students, remote workers, and entrepreneurs beat procrastination and distraction by connecting them with a real accountability partner — on demand, at any time.

Core Value Proposition
For
Who
We Provide
Unlike
Remote workers & students
Struggling with focus & procrastination
Real-time body-doubling sessions with verified partners
